# The ledgers ARE tracked — progress.md and the task briefs and reports. They
# carry the reasoning behind decisions that look arbitrary without it, and the
# handoff tells the next session to read them, which only works if they reach
# another checkout.
#
# The review diffs are not tracked. Each is a diff between two commits this
# repository already contains, so `git diff A..B` regenerates any of them
# exactly; storing them would be the same bytes a second time. They are also
# 162KB of the 292KB here.
*.diff

# macOS Finder droppings. Its own line rather than a blanket `*`, per the note
# above: the ledgers must stay tracked.
.DS_Store
